      "writtenOn": "2025-11-25T09:15:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is because these values are exported to user space and must match the expected values (`12` and `13`).\n\nTo avoid the confusing ordering, perhaps it\u0027s better to stick with the macro approach currently used by POLICYDC_CAP_MEMFD_CLASS. I\u0027ll revert to defining macros and using string literals. Let me update the CL accordingly.",
      "parentUuid": "ee70f0ab_fbf9cedf",
