      "writtenOn": "2025-11-21T18:27:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we expect the __POLICYDB_CAP_MAX_ANDROID to get exported to KMI? Is this a one shot addition to kabi to get these 4 policies added and then afterwards kabi would be affected? Trying to understand why this isn\u0027t extended iteratively with the patches that adds the policy functionality",
