      "writtenOn": "2025-11-25T09:15:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e  Is this a one shot addition to kabi to get these 4 policies added and then afterwards kabi would be affected?\n\nI\u0027m new to the KMI stability concept and thought these new identities were not in the KMI ABI since abi.sig wasn\u0027t updated. If we cannot add  new members even to this new array, right it is not what we intended, which I have to fix.",
