        "id": 1981075
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-25T09:15:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure, I\u0027ll make that change.\n\nFor my own understanding of GKI, there seems to be a trade-off between receiving more merge conflicts and the copy-and-pasted function being left outdated when the upstream code gets fixed. In general, do we want to prioritize avoiding the former?",
